      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MARATHON ROAD (2) boasts a consistent overall record including three wins from eight starts, the latest winning (19.86) over 350m at Traralgon. Performs well off this draw. Looks well placed here and should prove hard to beat again. ELUSIVE CURL (1) turned in a plain performance last time when fifth at Sandown over 515m behind Flying Ducati (29.93) in a Grade 4. Has a strong record from box 1, including two wins. Has ability and is one of the better chances. PAW LONNIE (7) scored well last start as odds-on favourite by 2.75 lengths at Bendigo in a handy 23.87 beating Dragon Train. Outside box to overcome but has a good record over this journey. Solid formlines coming through his last run. Should be in this for a long way. OH BISCUIT (8) is worth consideration after filling a hole last start.",
